To participate in the kernel outreachy, you should start with the
tutorial.  Go to http://kernelnewbies.org/OutreachyIntro and look for the
tutorial link in the How to apply section.

Once you have some patches accepted, you can start to work on the small
tasks of the projects listed on the OutreachyIntro page.

I'm not sure, but I think that you will need to change the spelling of
your name in your email address to use something closer to the Roman
alphabet.

